        "TileImage": "$($repository e3f211bf-79c4-4fe0-a5a0-34ad5b5de7f7).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47\r\r Your target is Riki Hirayama, a hacker exploiting the Patient Zero outbreak in Hokkaido. Hirayama has been using the crisis for personal gain. He’s currently in a high-security hospital. Make his death look like an accident related to his work environment. Ensure it appears as a tragic and unforeseen mishap. Good luck, 47.",
